// src/apps/apm-red/bottom-availability/tool.ts
var DEFAULT_DATASET9 = "otel-v1-apm-span-*";
var DEFAULT_LIMIT10 = 10;
var bottomAvailabilityRoute = defineRoute({
  id: "bottom-availability",
  tool: {
    title: "Bottom-K availability",
    description: "List services with the worst availability (`availability = 1 - fault_rate`). Pass `dataSourceId`; optional `dataset` (defaults `otel-v1-apm-span-*`) and `limit` (default 10). Sorts ascending by availability so the worst service appears at the top.",
    inputSchema: inputSchema64
  },
  propsSchema: propsSchema64,
  view: BottomAvailabilityView,
  handler: async ({ dataSourceId, dataset, limit }, ctx) => {
    const ds = dataset?.trim() || DEFAULT_DATASET9;
    const lim = limit ?? DEFAULT_LIMIT10;
    const query = `source = ${ds} | where serviceName != "" | eval isErr = if(statusCode = 2, 1, 0) | stats count() as total, sum(isErr) as errors by serviceName | eval faultRate = errors / total | eval availability = 1 - faultRate | sort + availability | head ${lim}`;
    ctx.logger.log("[apm-red.bottom-availability] PPL: " + query);
    const baseProps = {
      dataset: ds,
      query
    };
    try {
      const result = await ctx.osUi.runPpl(dataSourceId, query, ds);
      const rows = pplRows(result).map((r8) => {
        const total = r8.getNumber("total");
        const errors = r8.getNumber("errors");
        const faultRate = total > 0 ? errors / total : 0;
        return {
          serviceName: r8.getString("serviceName"),
          total,
          errors,
          faultRate,
          availability: 1 - faultRate
        };
      });
      const props = { ...baseProps, rows };
      return {
        props,
        text: rows.length === 0 ? `No services found in ${ds}.` : `Bottom ${rows.length} service(s) by availability.`
      };
    } catch (err) {
      const msg = errorMessage(err);
      ctx.logger.error("[apm-red.bottom-availability] PPL failed: " + msg);
      const props = {
        ...baseProps,
        rows: [],
        error: msg
      };
      return { props, text: "Failed: " + msg, isError: true };
    }
  }
});

